# Citation metadata, in Citation File Format 1.2.0.

cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in published work, please cite it."
title: "QualSafe Desktop"
abstract: >-
  A local-first desktop application for qualitative analysis: reading and
  hand-coding documents by character-exact passage, building a hierarchical
  codebook, boolean and framework-matrix querying, per-code Cohen's kappa
  between human coders, and optional transformer-assisted first-pass coding of
  survey open text. All analysis runs on the user's own machine; no text is
  transmitted.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rizwanur
    family-names: Rob
